Here’s how to add support for `elf_i386`:

### 🛠️ Install an i386 Cross-Compiler Toolchain

You’ll need `binutils` and `gcc` configured for `i386-elf`. You can either build them yourself or use prebuilt toolchains.

#### Option 1: Use Prebuilt Toolchain
GitHub repositories like [lordmilko/i686-elf-tools](https://github.com/lordmilko/i686-elf-tools) or [yasnakateb/i686Tools](https://github.com/yasnakateb/i686Tools) offer scripts and binaries to install an i386-elf toolchain.

